{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14304","headline":"四皓驿听琴送王师简归湖南使幕 · 窦庠","name":"四皓驿听琴送王师简归湖南使幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱弦韵正调，清夜似闻韶。\n山馆月犹在，松枝雪未消。\n城笳三奏晓，别鹤一声遥。\n明日思君处，春泉翻寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦庠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}